\[
\frac{8}{10}\div 4=\frac{8}{10}\times\frac{1}{4}
    =\frac{8}{40}
    =\frac{1}{5}
\]

So each piece is \(\boxed{\tfrac{1}{5}\text{ meter}}\) (0.20 m).

